  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for inclusion - South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase access to micro finance, savings and loans groups for persons with disabilities, particularly in rural areas. The project includes gender-responsive programming, working on formal and informal socio-cultural barriers to create an enabling environment for the participation of girls/women and it supports women-led organizations for persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
